# This is a public, standalone project (github.com/youproof-org) — resolve all
# dependencies from the public npm registry. Without this, installs inherit
# whatever default registry a contributor has in their machine-level ~/.npmrc
# (e.g. a private corporate JFrog mirror), which both breaks installs for anyone
# without that mirror's auth and is the wrong source for this project's public
# deps. Pinning it here makes local installs deterministic and match CI.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
